---
// The hero object: six Kit modules on a plaza, one per verb. Decorative (aria-hidden); the verb list
// beside it is the real navigation. The live scene is 3D (kit3d/); these two renders of the same scene
// hold its place: the empty plaza while the 3D loads, the full plaza where WebGL is not available.
---
<div class="cluster" aria-hidden="true" data-cluster>
  <img class="cluster__still cluster__still--full" src="/kit/plaza-full.webp" width="1400" height="1434" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" draggable="false" />
  <img class="cluster__still cluster__still--plate" src="/kit/plaza-plate.webp" width="1400" height="1434" alt="" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" draggable="false" />
</div>
